      "content": "Phuket? No, definitely skip Phuket. The exec doesn't have time for side trips, it's strictly business. Also, can we fix the HCMC hotel? Mongkok is in Hong Kong, not Vietnam. Can you redo the schedule focusing on just the three cities (Singapore, Bangkok, HCMC) and maybe add some specific details for the dinner windows? I need to know if they can make a 7pm reservation after their afternoon meetings.",
